          "description": "There is a place, a magical place called Mountain Goat Mountain! Legend has it that it is home to a mysterious creature that no one is certain actually exists.  \n\nPerhaps it does? Perhaps you'd like to see for yourself?   \n\n‘Mountain Goat Mountain’ is an interactive audio theatre experience that bumps families out of the ordinary, and into a world where you work together to uncover its secrets and discover the hidden treasures in each other.    \n\nSo gather your costumes and put your hiking boots on  because in this adventure, everyone plays along!  \n\n\"\"The children have asked to do “Mountain Goat Mountain” again and again…\"\" -  New York Times   \n\nMountain Goat Mountain is designed for the whole family to enjoy together. We encourage you to find a time when everyone in your family can be together without distraction.  \n\nTo get the most out of this interactive audio experience, you will need: Your family, a bed sheet and some pencils and paper.",
          "author": "Created by Zoë Barry, Tahli Corin, Liz Francis, Nikita Hederics and Sarah Lockwood.",
